# Every text file is checked out with LF on every OS, including Windows. Shell installers must have LF, and a CRLF `#!` line on
# the scripts/*.mjs files breaks the test runner's module loader (the cause of the first Windows CI failure).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.png binary
